# =============================================================================
# Prettier (root) — ignore patterns
# =============================================================================
# This controls the ROOT-level Prettier (for Markdown / YAML / JSON / etc.).
# The frontend has its own `.prettierignore` inside `frontend/`.
# Frontend TS/TSX/CSS files are formatted by the frontend-local Prettier
# config, so we exclude the whole `frontend/` directory from the root tool to
# avoid double-formatting.
# =============================================================================

